# Exploratory studies remain local until they are curated. The repository ships
# only the two reviewable end-to-end experiment directories listed below.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/2026-08-oracle-prepared-instant-end-to-end/
!/2026-08-prepared-instant-full-benchmark/

# Local experiment products. Keep them on the machine that produced the run;
# commit the runner, configuration, checksums, summaries, and curated reports.
**/raw/
**/parsed/
**/reproduced/
**/cache/
**/oracle_workdir/
**/*.log
**/*.log.gz
**/*.jsonl
**/*.sample
**/plan_differences.csv
**/reference_regressions.csv

# Interrupted or ad-hoc reproductions must not replace an archived result.
**/*.tmp
